    {
      "_id": 11502,
      "id": "adagio_phantom_night_dancers",
      "name": "Adagio: Phantom Night Dancers",
      "description": "With slow, graceful dance steps, Odette deals <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">AoE Cryo DMG</span> to the opponent, and also summons her <b><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Solo Dance Double</span></b> to the field.<br/>If a <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Dance Double</span> summoned by Odette is already on the field, this will re-summon the Dance Double and reset its duration.<br/><br/><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Solo Dance Double</span><br/>Alternates between the <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Plume</span> and <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Wing</span> dance moves, periodically attacking nearby opponents and dealing to them <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">AoE Cryo DMG</span>.<br/>Additionally, for 6s after unleashing the Elemental Skill <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Adagio: Phantom Night Dancers</span>, Odette's Elemental Skill <span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Adagio: Phantom Night Dancers</span> will become the special Elemental Skill <b><span style=\"color:#FFD780FF\">Adagio: Coda at Dawn's Tolling</span></b> instead, where a dance duet deals <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">AoE Cryo DMG</span> to nearby opponents over time. Then, when the duet ends, she deals another instance of <span style=\"color:#99FFFFFF\">AoE Cryo DMG</span> that is considered Stellar-Conduct or Stellar Swirl DMG.",
